kind: scene
id: common.festival
title: The Lantern Festival
on: slotStart
when: "@festivalNight"
priority: 20
after: 'visited("common.eve")'
---

## The jetty

::bg{location="lakeshore" time="night"}
::music{action="start" mood="festive" volume="normal"}
::vfx{type="lanterns"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The whole school walks down to the water with paper lanterns. The lake takes them one at a time, as if it has been waiting all year.
::use{component="cg" id="cgFestival" instance="use-001"}
@nana{code="0010" emotion="happy" when="quest.festivalPrep.state == 'complete'"}: Our dorm's lanterns are the brightest three on the water. Told you we'd make it.
@nana{code="0020" emotion="sad" when="quest.festivalPrep.state == 'failed'"}: Our window is the dark one this year. Next year. Probably.
@nana{code="0030" emotion="teasing"}: So. Island tradition. Who's holding the other side of your lantern?

<branch id="lantern" prompt="Whose hand is on the other side of your lantern?">
  <choice id="ren" label="Ren, who came down to the jetty without his register" when="holds('routeOpen', ['ren'])" into="run.route" value="ren">
    @ren{code="0010" emotion="flustered"}: I am here in an official capacity. Mostly. Hold it level, please.
  </choice>
  <choice id="mika" label="Mika, still in his relay shirt" when="holds('routeOpen', ['mika'])" into="run.route" value="mika">
    @mika{code="0010" emotion="laughing"}: Me? Really? Okay — okay! I'm not crying, the lake's just really bright.
  </choice>
  <choice id="soren" label="Soren, at the edge of the crowd with a book under his arm" when="holds('routeOpen', ['soren'])" into="run.route" value="soren">
    @soren{code="0010" emotion="shy"}: I wrote something on ours. You can read it. Later. Much later.
  </choice>
  <choice id="kai" label="Kai, who says he only came for the noise" when="holds('routeOpen', ['kai'])" into="run.route" value="kai">
    @kai{code="0010" emotion="smirk"}: Fine. But I'm writing the wish. Yours would be embarrassing.
  </choice>
  <choice id="hotaru" label="The girl on the far jetty, who has no lantern of her own" when="quest.fourLanterns.state == 'complete'" into="run.route" value="hotaru">
    @hotaru{code="0010" emotion="sad"}: Nobody has ever floated one with me. I don't know how to hold it.
    @you{code="0010"}: Like this. Both hands.
  </choice>
  <choice id="alone" label="Float it on your own" into="run.route" value="alone">
    @you{code="0020" mono}: My lantern. My wish. The lake can keep a secret.
  </choice>
</branch>

@narrator{code="0020"}: The lantern leaves your hands and does not look back.
